# Tantivy's runtime lock files. The indexes themselves (sources/fulltext/)
# and the vector indexes (sources/vectors/) *are* committed, so the optional
# search features work from a checkout with no build step. Regenerate with:
#   cargo run --features fulltext --bin qql-index
#   python3 scripts/build-vectors.py
.tantivy-meta.lock
.tantivy-writer.lock

